WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.673
Meditation offers 
the opportunity,

00:00:03.673 --> 00:00:05.916
the potential&nbsp;to step back

00:00:05.916 --> 00:00:08.466
and to get a different perspective,

00:00:08.466 --> 00:00:10.549
to see that things aren't always

00:00:11.207 --> 00:00:12.218
as they appear.

00:00:13.253 --> 00:00:16.517
We can't change every little thing

00:00:16.517 --> 00:00:17.800
that happens to us in life,

00:00:18.828 --> 00:00:20.156
but we can change

00:00:20.156 --> 00:00:22.455
the way that we&nbsp;experience it.

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:25.469
That's the potential 
of meditation,

